Overview:
==========

This set of directories contain an example standard cell library and
the associated files needed to run the SUE Data Path Compiler (DPC).
This includes placement, timing (using either Cadence's Pearl static
timing analyser or Synopsys's Primetime static timing analyser),
verilog, and router data (LEF) for the library.  This library corresponds 
to 0.25 um TSMC technology.


Disclaimer:
============

MICRO MAGIC, INC. MAKES NO CLAIMS OR GUARANTEES, WHATSOEVER, ABOUT THE
ACCURACY OF THE TIMING MODELS OR THE CORRECTNESS OF THE LAYOUTS (EITHER
